msgid "The **backend for your multiplayer game** — accounts, lobbies, chat, leaderboards and everything players expect around the game itself. Server-side scripting in Elixir runs your own logic where players cannot reach it: scoring, rewards, matchmaking rules, validation. **You run it on your own server** — there is no hosted service."
